# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0088.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Browser (Player) -> CDN (Static Hosting): Requests static files
UI Screens -> Scene Manager
Scene Manager -> ECS
ECS -> Systems
Systems -> Renderer
Client State -> UI Screens
Client State -> ECS
Parts Registry -> UI Screens
Parts Registry -> ECS
Persistence -> Client State
Asset Loader -> Renderer
Content Packs (JSON/TS) -> Parts Registry
CDN (Static Hosting) -> Static App (React + TypeScript): Serves app & assets

Static App (React + TypeScript) { UI Screens, Scene Manager, Renderer, ECS, Systems, Client State, Parts Registry, Persistence, Asset Loader, Content Packs (JSON/TS) }
